We go to Rottnest Island for Mya's first time here and only my second time. We spend the day exploring many beautiful beaches and spots along the island with a super nice snorkel at Little Salmon Bay. We even park up on Green Island for lunch. What a spot. An epic day out here and cannot wait to go back soon.

If you want to support the channel you can grab some stickers from the [shop](/shop) and I will send them out to you, anywhere in Australia.

## Dive stats

- **Location:** Rottnest Island, WA
- **Date:** 10 October 2026
- **Depth:** 1.9m Average Depth, 3.6m Max Depth
- **Visibility:** 10-15m

## Highlights

Western King Wrasse and lots of schooling fish.
